WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.105
A discovery update improves the equally

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.973
weighted mean of three displayed

00:00:04.993 --> 00:00:07.654
evaluation rows from point three zero to

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.148
about point three three.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:10.308
Would you call it better?

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.266
Pause before looking at the rows.

00:00:12.442 --> 00:00:14.483
What change could that average conceal?

00:00:16.886 --> 00:00:18.898
In the chapter’s hypothetical table, the

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.630
identifier row falls from point three to

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.955
point one precision at ten: a two thirds

00:00:24.975 --> 00:00:28.370
relative loss. Another row improves enough

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.542
to lift the mean.

00:00:29.717 --> 00:00:32.081
These are illustrative source numbers, not

00:00:32.101 --> 00:00:34.414
a product update or experiment performed

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:35.354
for this film.

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:40.720
The identifier query concerns S L C six A

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.794
four promoter polymorphism.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.669
The hypothetical expansion drops the gene

00:00:45.689 --> 00:00:48.800
symbol. A vocabulary mismatch row rises

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.003
from point two to point five.

00:00:51.178 --> 00:00:54.006
The composition row stays at point four.

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:57.043
That last row averages two opposite

00:00:57.063 --> 00:00:59.800
meaning queries, each judged separately.

00:00:59.988 --> 00:01:02.030
The chapter’s reported average equally

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:04.904
weights the three displayed rows; it is

00:01:04.924 --> 00:01:07.159
not a mean of four equally weighted

00:01:07.179 --> 00:01:08.602
individual queries.

00:01:08.751 --> 00:01:10.858
Known relevant counts are seed

00:01:10.878 --> 00:01:13.280
information, not proof of exhaustive

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.961
relevance. Keep both qualifications with

00:01:15.981 --> 00:01:16.746
the table.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.100
Thirty to fifty queries are a practical

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:21.259
starting range.

00:01:21.395 --> 00:01:24.288
Use reference enquiries, loan requests,

00:01:24.308 --> 00:01:26.594
consultations and training questions,

00:01:26.614 --> 00:01:28.901
carrying the disciplines, languages and

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.246
document types your library encounters.

00:01:31.408 --> 00:01:34.029
Include searches already known to fail,

00:01:34.295 --> 00:01:36.311
rather than only demonstration friendly

00:01:36.331 --> 00:01:37.277
examples.

00:01:37.828 --> 00:01:40.722
Rerunning an established set may fit an

00:01:40.742 --> 00:01:43.789
afternoon. Constructing needs and judging

00:01:43.809 --> 00:01:46.791
hundreds of results can take much longer.

00:01:46.953 --> 00:01:49.188
Write down the task and what counts as

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:52.023
useful, then record known relevant items

00:01:52.043 --> 00:01:54.407
and grades where staff can defend them.

00:01:54.582 --> 00:01:56.701
This is a local baseline, not an

00:01:56.721 --> 00:01:58.801
exhaustive research collection.

00:01:59.716 --> 00:02:01.815
Choose a fixed depth, such as ten or

00:02:01.835 --> 00:02:04.804
twenty, and keep it fixed across runs.

00:02:04.966 --> 00:02:07.756
Pool and deduplicate both runs’ results at

00:02:07.776 --> 00:02:10.707
that depth. Judge every pooled record

00:02:10.727 --> 00:02:13.593
under the same written criteria, ideally

00:02:13.613 --> 00:02:16.299
without seeing which system supplied it.

00:02:16.852 --> 00:02:19.131
Calculate precision at that depth from

00:02:19.151 --> 00:02:20.355
those judgements.

00:02:20.504 --> 00:02:23.203
Report known seed recovery separately.

00:02:23.352 --> 00:02:26.270
If a run returns fewer records, record the

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.499
count and denominator convention.

00:02:28.662 --> 00:02:31.051
Otherwise a change in depth, missing

00:02:31.071 --> 00:02:33.796
judgements or an unstated denominator can

00:02:33.816 --> 00:02:36.528
masquerade as a system improvement.

00:02:37.432 --> 00:02:40.728
Include an exact identifier, gene name or

00:02:40.748 --> 00:02:41.810
chemical string.

00:02:41.985 --> 00:02:44.568
Include a phrase appearing only in full

00:02:44.588 --> 00:02:47.725
text you hold. Include a query whose known

00:02:47.745 --> 00:02:50.547
relevant record shares almost none of its

00:02:50.567 --> 00:02:53.395
wording. Include near identical queries

00:02:53.415 --> 00:02:54.748
with opposite meaning.

00:02:55.324 --> 00:02:57.694
These probe a surviving lexical route,

00:02:57.895 --> 00:03:00.594
indexed units, vocabulary bridging and

00:03:00.614 --> 00:03:02.810
composition. They are diagnostic

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:05.903
comparisons, not a guarantee that one

00:03:05.923 --> 00:03:08.583
score can explain every failure.

00:03:08.758 --> 00:03:11.096
Preserve the record and capture details

00:03:11.116 --> 00:03:13.467
needed to investigate a change.

00:03:13.642 --> 00:03:16.083
The earlier chapter supplies hypotheses

00:03:16.103 --> 00:03:17.990
about why a query lost.

00:03:18.886 --> 00:03:21.439
Inspect queries that moved sharply,

00:03:21.576 --> 00:03:23.668
including differences by discipline,

00:03:23.934 --> 00:03:25.756
language or document type.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:28.334
A mean can absorb systematic harm to a

00:03:28.354 --> 00:03:30.009
small group of searches.

00:03:30.171 --> 00:03:32.715
A difference smaller than ordinary run to

00:03:32.735 --> 00:03:35.731
run variation may need further evidence

00:03:35.751 --> 00:03:37.509
before you can distinguish it from that

00:03:37.529 --> 00:03:38.424
variation.

00:03:38.987 --> 00:03:41.079
Ask a vendor which queries, which

00:03:41.099 --> 00:03:43.527
collection, whose binary or graded

00:03:43.547 --> 00:03:46.362
judgements, which depth, which metric and

00:03:46.382 --> 00:03:48.578
which baseline produced the claimed gain.

00:03:48.753 --> 00:03:51.284
Then rerun the hard local questions.

00:03:51.446 --> 00:03:54.403
The local set generalises narrowly by

00:03:54.423 --> 00:03:57.161
design; its value is that the library

00:03:57.181 --> 00:03:59.171
chose the relevance criteria.

00:04:00.071 --> 00:04:02.271
If the product also writes an answer,

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.462
evaluate whether it is faithful to the

00:04:04.482 --> 00:04:07.284
retrieved material and whether each claim

00:04:07.304 --> 00:04:09.500
traces to a source that contains it.

00:04:09.676 --> 00:04:11.756
Those are additional questions, not

00:04:11.776 --> 00:04:14.397
substitutes for evaluating retrieval.

00:04:14.943 --> 00:04:17.394
A perfectly faithful summary of the wrong

00:04:17.414 --> 00:04:20.152
ten documents is still built on the wrong

00:04:20.172 --> 00:04:23.193
shortlist. A groundedness check cannot

00:04:23.213 --> 00:04:26.093
reveal every relevant paper that retrieval

00:04:26.113 --> 00:04:29.057
missed. Keep retrieval quality, answer

00:04:29.077 --> 00:04:32.304
faithfulness and source support visible as

00:04:32.324 --> 00:04:33.837
separate requirements.

00:04:34.743 --> 00:04:36.999
Rerun the fixed local set after a model

00:04:37.019 --> 00:04:40.453
update, index change, platform migration

00:04:40.473 --> 00:04:41.638
or before renewal.

00:04:41.787 --> 00:04:43.713
Compare per query against the saved

00:04:43.733 --> 00:04:46.445
baseline, keep the criteria and depth

00:04:46.465 --> 00:04:48.932
stable, and investigate regressions

00:04:48.952 --> 00:04:51.072
instead of letting a small mean gain

00:04:51.092 --> 00:04:52.295
settle the decision.

00:04:52.856 --> 00:04:55.453
Measurement can identify which system

00:04:55.473 --> 00:04:57.850
performed better on these queries against

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:58.996
these judgements.

00:04:59.158 --> 00:05:01.471
It does not explain the internal cause or

00:05:01.491 --> 00:05:03.635
make the search repeatable next year.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:05.942
Chapter fifteen turns to what must be

00:05:05.962 --> 00:05:08.854
recorded, inspected and required.

00:05:09.017 --> 00:05:11.394
The evaluation is useful because its

00:05:11.414 --> 00:05:13.506
comparison is explicit.
